//============================================================
// Which levels are drawn, their labels, sizing and extension are all locked — the
// single "Liquidity Levels" toggle in Chart Tools is the whole panel surface.
// Level tracking + sweep detection always run (the A+ sequence arms off a sweep and
// the LIQ BSL/SSL rows read it); drawLiq blanks the drawn lines and labels.
bool i_showLiquidity = true
